{"title":"Mother Sallow","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Mother Sallow is a named <a href=\"#/monster/giant-spider\">Giant Spider</a> seen at level 12.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Mother Sallow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>Silkfall Hollow</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 2×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-334\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"mother-sallow\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>What it can drop</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/b0da82e05325b947558f.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/broodsilk-robe-torso\"><b>Broodsilk Robe</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Imp Torso)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">+15% damage against a slowed target (chilled, hobbled or rooted).</span></li>\n      <li><b>Gear every kill:</b> a piece from its tier, excellent or better, and a second piece 1 kill in 5.</li>\n      <li><b>Gold</b> worth about 5 ordinary kills.</li>\n      <li><b>Enchanted:</b> 1 kill in 100 enchants a piece (up to 9c, and only what its material can hold).</li>\n      <li><b>Elite:</b> a boss spawns elite 1 time in 100, and an elite makes its unique 5 times as likely.</li></ul>\n      <p class=\"muted\">From the game’s rules and its own guide. See <a href=\"#/guide/unique-items\">Unique items</a>.</p>\n      <h2>Drops players have recorded</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mother-sallow-fang\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/299089201a6780acb932.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mother Sallow Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"leather-head\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ad0df36ce44572a810c0.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Leather Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"deerhide-torso\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/46ad0df4e1b98abc4642.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Deerhide Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Other named Giant Spiders</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/nest-spider\">Nest Spider</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/loom-nest-spider\">Loom Nest Spider</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/tessa-s-wolf-spider\">Tessa&#39;s Wolf Spider</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/mossback\">Mossback</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/18a260cc427b201aa0b5.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Mother Sallow</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/giant-spider\">Giant Spider</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>12</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>111</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>2 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}